{"page":182,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.1 • 트랜스포트 계용 서비스 및 개요","words":[{"text":"3.1","x":948,"y":149,"width":37,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1021,"y":153,"width":12,"height":14},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1065,"y":147,"width":131,"height":30},{"text":"계용","x":1208,"y":149,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"서비스","x":1268,"y":150,"width":77,"height":28},{"text":"및","x":1356,"y":148,"width":23,"height":29},{"text":"개요","x":1392,"y":148,"width":50,"height":28}]},{"text":"로세스끼리 전송하는 메시지에 대한 지연 보장이나 대역폭 보장을 제공할 수 없다.","words":[{"text":"로세스끼리","x":197,"y":271,"width":164,"height":40},{"text":"전송하는","x":379,"y":274,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"메시지에","x":522,"y":275,"width":126,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":664,"y":275,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"지연","x":740,"y":275,"width":59,"height":38},{"text":"보장이나","x":812,"y":277,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"대역폭","x":952,"y":276,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"보장을","x":1062,"y":275,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"제공할","x":1176,"y":275,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1285,"y":276,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"없다.","x":1332,"y":274,"width":70,"height":38}]},{"text":"그럼에도 불구하고 하위 네트워크 프로토콜이 상-유하는 서비스를 제공하지 못할","words":[{"text":"그럼에도","x":261,"y":333,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"불구하고","x":412,"y":334,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"하위","x":560,"y":335,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":640,"y":335,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":781,"y":336,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"상-유하는","x":954,"y":335,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":1103,"y":335,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"제공하지","x":1252,"y":334,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"못할","x":1398,"y":334,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"때에도, 특정 서비스는 트랜스포트 프로토콜에 의해서 제-공될 수 있다. 예를 들어, 트랜","words":[{"text":"때에도,","x":198,"y":392,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"특정","x":318,"y":394,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"서비스는","x":399,"y":394,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":543,"y":395,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜에","x":716,"y":395,"width":155,"height":37},{"text":"의해서","x":887,"y":395,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"제-공될","x":996,"y":394,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1106,"y":396,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1150,"y":396,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":1234,"y":394,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":1311,"y":393,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"트랜","x":1398,"y":393,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"스포트 계층은 하위 네트워크 프로토콜이 비신뢰적일 때, 즉 네트워크 프로토콜이 패","words":[{"text":"스포트","x":197,"y":455,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"계층은","x":313,"y":453,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"하위","x":428,"y":454,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":509,"y":454,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":652,"y":454,"width":155,"height":37},{"text":"비신뢰적일","x":827,"y":454,"width":156,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1001,"y":454,"width":39,"height":36},{"text":"즉","x":1056,"y":455,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":1106,"y":454,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":1252,"y":453,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"패","x":1433,"y":452,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"것을 분실하거나 손상하거나 복사본을 만들 때에도, 에플리게이션에게 신뢰적인 데이","words":[{"text":"것을","x":199,"y":512,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"분실하거나","x":275,"y":513,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"손상하거나","x":458,"y":513,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"복사본을","x":636,"y":513,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"만들","x":777,"y":513,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"때에도,","x":855,"y":513,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"에플리게이션에게","x":973,"y":512,"width":262,"height":38},{"text":"신뢰적인","x":1253,"y":511,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"데이","x":1400,"y":512,"width":61,"height":36}]},{"text":"터 전송 서비스를 제공할 수 있다. 다른 예(8장의 네트워크 보안 참조)처럼, 트랜스포","words":[{"text":"터","x":198,"y":571,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"전송","x":245,"y":571,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"서비스를","x":326,"y":572,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"제공할","x":474,"y":572,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":586,"y":573,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":634,"y":572,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":718,"y":572,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"예(8장의","x":797,"y":572,"width":121,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":937,"y":571,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"보안","x":1082,"y":572,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"참조)처럼,","x":1163,"y":571,"width":152,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포","x":1332,"y":570,"width":131,"height":36}]},{"text":"트 프로토콜은 네트워크 계층이 트랜스포트 계층 세그먼트의 기밀성을 보장할 수 없을","words":[{"text":"트","x":196,"y":634,"width":31,"height":28},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":239,"y":632,"width":170,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":422,"y":631,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"계층이","x":566,"y":632,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":673,"y":631,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":846,"y":631,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":919,"y":630,"width":160,"height":37},{"text":"기밀성을","x":1097,"y":630,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"보장할","x":1241,"y":630,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1353,"y":630,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"없을","x":1400,"y":630,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"때도 침입자가 에플리게이션 메시지를 읽지 못하도록 암호화를 사용할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"때도","x":197,"y":690,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"침입자가","x":275,"y":689,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"에플리게이션","x":420,"y":690,"width":196,"height":37},{"text":"메시지를","x":630,"y":690,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"읽지","x":769,"y":690,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"못하도록","x":842,"y":689,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"암호화를","x":984,"y":689,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"사용할","x":1126,"y":689,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1238,"y":689,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1286,"y":688,"width":70,"height":37}]},{"text":"3.1.2 인터넷 트랜스포트 계층의 개요","words":[{"text":"3.1.2","x":196,"y":799,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"인터넷","x":362,"y":798,"width":119,"height":44},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":493,"y":798,"width":199,"height":42},{"text":"계층의","x":704,"y":796,"width":112,"height":45},{"text":"개요","x":832,"y":797,"width":78,"height":43}]},{"text":"인터넷, 좀 더 일반적으로 TCP/IP 네트워크는 애플리케이션 계층에게 두 가지 구별되","words":[{"text":"인터넷,","x":197,"y":896,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"좀","x":315,"y":898,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":364,"y":898,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"일반적으로","x":411,"y":897,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"TCP/IP","x":586,"y":900,"width":111,"height":29},{"text":"네트워크는","x":712,"y":895,"width":158,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":883,"y":893,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"계층에게","x":1092,"y":893,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1236,"y":895,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":1284,"y":894,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"구별되","x":1362,"y":894,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"는 트랜스포트 계층 프로토콜들을 제공한다는 것을 배웠다. 하나는 애플리게이션에게","words":[{"text":"는","x":196,"y":961,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":241,"y":957,"width":166,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":423,"y":958,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜들을","x":502,"y":955,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"제공한다는","x":711,"y":955,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":885,"y":954,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"배웠다.","x":962,"y":953,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"하나는","x":1082,"y":952,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션에게","x":1195,"y":953,"width":264,"height":38}]},{"text":"비신뢰적이고 비연결형인 서비스를 제공하는 UDP (User Datagram Protocol)이고,","words":[{"text":"비신뢰적이고","x":197,"y":1017,"width":197,"height":39},{"text":"비연결형인","x":413,"y":1016,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"서비스를","x":595,"y":1015,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"제공하는","x":741,"y":1016,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"UDP","x":884,"y":1019,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"(User","x":974,"y":1019,"width":83,"height":36},{"text":"Datagram","x":1073,"y":1018,"width":151,"height":37},{"text":"Protocol)이고,","x":1241,"y":1014,"width":221,"height":39}]},{"text":"다른 하나는 애플리케이션에게 신뢰적이고 연결지향형 서비스를 제공하는 TCP","words":[{"text":"다른","x":197,"y":1080,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"하나는","x":281,"y":1078,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션에게","x":405,"y":1076,"width":269,"height":40},{"text":"신뢰적이고","x":698,"y":1077,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"연결지향형","x":884,"y":1076,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"서비스를","x":1070,"y":1075,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"제공하는","x":1227,"y":1077,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1384,"y":1079,"width":80,"height":30}]},{"text":"(Transmission control Protocol)이다. 네트워크 애플리게이션을 설계할 때, 애플리게","words":[{"text":"(Transmission","x":196,"y":1144,"width":212,"height":36},{"text":"control","x":423,"y":1143,"width":114,"height":30},{"text":"Protocol)이다.","x":552,"y":1138,"width":210,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":779,"y":1138,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션을","x":920,"y":1137,"width":228,"height":39},{"text":"설계할","x":1161,"y":1138,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"때,","x":1274,"y":1138,"width":41,"height":39},{"text":"애플리게","x":1331,"y":1137,"width":130,"height":39}]},{"text":"이선 개발자는 이 두 가지 트랜스포트 프로토콜 중의 하나를 명시해야 한다. 2.7절에서","words":[{"text":"이선","x":197,"y":1201,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"개발자는","x":272,"y":1200,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":418,"y":1200,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":462,"y":1202,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":508,"y":1199,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":584,"y":1199,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜","x":758,"y":1201,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"중의","x":897,"y":1200,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"하나를","x":975,"y":1199,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"명시해야","x":1085,"y":1199,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1227,"y":1200,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"2.7절에서","x":1316,"y":1200,"width":145,"height":39}]},{"text":"보았듯이, 애플리케이션 개발자는 소켓을 생성할 때 TCP와 UDP 중에서 하나를 선택","words":[{"text":"보았듯이,","x":196,"y":1261,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":349,"y":1261,"width":198,"height":39},{"text":"개발자는","x":563,"y":1261,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"소켓을","x":705,"y":1261,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"생성할","x":815,"y":1261,"width":97,"height":38}